// Damage limits of the Survivor damage module (L4D2), one per weapon.
//
// Copy this file to lilac_survivor_damage.cfg and keep only the weapons whose
// damage your server changes. A value here replaces the built-in limit.
// The value is the most damage one survivor can do to a Tank in one second.
// 0 turns the check off for that weapon.
//
// Apply the changes with: lilac_survivor_damage_reload
"SurvivorDamage"
{
